    <briefdescription>
<para>File-backed <ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1user__storage_1_1_i_rotation_store" kindref="compound">IRotationStore</ref> using a flat JSON file for persistence. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread-safe via an internal mutex. File format: <programlisting filename=".json"><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>&quot;user_storage:rotation_state:vs-nfd&quot;:<sp/>&quot;{\&quot;last_check_ms\&quot;:1711234567890}&quot;,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
